OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in her 80s dies after crash
OL,4,Aat junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has died following a
OL,7,Fcollision at a junction.
OL,9,FNorfolk Police said the incident
OL,10,Finvolved a blue Citroen C1 travelling
OL,11,Fsouth along Beccles Road and a black
OL,12,FLand Rover Discovery which was
OL,13,Ftravelling in the opposite direction,
OL,14,Fat the junction with Church Lane in
OL,15,FBradwell on Saturday at 12:06 BST.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Citroen, a woman in
OL,18,Fher 80s, who was the only occupant of
OL,19,Fthe vehicle, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
